{"E:\\videos\\olc02\\wt\\vlog\\olc03\\voz\\b002_t3.wav": {"text": "At 30 below, then at 7 o'clock he was holding his bowl out for the third time, and he didn't say another word about it. So tonight I'm going to show you exactly how I made that soup, seven secrets one at a time, and I priced it at the store this week. A pot that feeds six people comes to about $3.30. That's about 55 cents a bowl, friend, under a dollar, even with today's prices. And the last secret, the one about the bread, is the reason that soup kept forty men full all night. Most people have never heard it. You know me, I'm old. I cooked in the logging camps up in northern Minnesota on a wood range in a log cook shack for crews of forty men and sometimes more. Before that I learned in my mother's kitchen a little farmhouse with a blue enamel coffee pot that never once left the back of the stove. Quick, while I have you.", "words": [{"w": " At", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": " 30", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.52}, {"w": " below,", "s": 0.52, "e": 1.36}, {"w": " then", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.5}, {"w": " at", "s": 1.5, "e": 1.68}, {"w": " 7", "s": 1.68, "e": 2.0}, {"w": " o'clock", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.34}, {"w": " he", "s": 2.34, "e": 2.58}, {"w": " was", "s": 2.58, "e": 2.78}, {"w": " holding", "s": 2.78, "e": 3.1}, {"w": " his", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.34}, {"w": " bowl", "s": 3.34, "e": 3.62}, {"w": " out", "s": 3.62, "e": 3.9}, {"w": " for", "s": 3.9, "e": 4.06}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.06, "e": 4.24}, {"w": " third", "s": 4.24, "e": 4.48}, {"w": " time,", "s": 4.48, "e": 5.28}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.28, "e": 5.4}, {"w": " he", "s": 5.4, "e": 5.52}, {"w": " didn't", "s": 5.52, "e": 5.8}, {"w": " say", "s": 5.8, "e": 6.06}, {"w": " another", "s": 6.06, "e": 6.44}, {"w": " word", "s": 6.44, "e": 6.74}, {"w": " about", "s": 6.74, "e": 7.12}, {"w": " it.", "s": 7.12, "e": 7.34}, {"w": " So", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.84}, {"w": " tonight", "s": 7.84, "e": 8.22}, {"w": " I'm", "s": 8.22, "e": 8.46}, {"w": " going", "s": 8.46, "e": 8.7}, {"w"